title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0 and (not historical_mode)
on-arrival: fundraising_timer = 6; month_actions += 1; resource_monthly_limit = 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/money.png
tags: party_affairs
go-to: monies_menu

= Fundraising

For better or for worse, the party cannot exist without money.

@monies_menu
on-arrival: {! 

    Q.monies_disp = Math.min(6, Math.max(0, Math.round(Q.dues * 1.0 + (Math.max(0, Q.patronage) / 10) * 2 + Q.salary_cut * 3 + (Math.max(0, Q.big_monies) / 10) * 3)));

!}

- @increase_dues: Increase Party Dues
- @decrease_dues: Decrease Party Dues
- @increase_patronage: Hand Out More Federal Jobs
- @decrease_patronage: Reduce Federal Patronage
- @increase_assessments: Increase Salary Assessments
- @decrease_assessments: Decrease Salary Assessments
- @business_donations: Encourage Business Donations
- @business_donations_no: Discourage Business Donations
- @collect: <span style="color: #07690b;">**COLLECT OUR CASH**</span>

@decrease_dues
subtitle: New dues: -[+ dues - 0.5 +] resources
choose-if: dues > 0.5 and resource_monthly_limit >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if dues <= 0.5: Dues are already as low as they can go. ?][? if resource_monthly_limit < 1: We can't change the system all at once. ?]
on-arrival: dues -= 0.5; workers_rep += 2; unemployed_rep += 2; middle_class_dissent -= 1; resource_monthly_limit -= 1
go-to: monies_menu

Our current members appreciate this, but no one decides to join a party because of the low dues.

@increase_dues
subtitle: New dues: [+ dues + 0.5 +] resources [? if unemployed >= 15 : Given the present economic situation, this may be painful. ?][? if dues >= 3.5 : Dues are already rather high; increasing them might reduce our membership. ?]
choose-if: dues < 5 and resource_monthly_limit >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if dues >= 5: We can't ask our members for a single cent more. ?][? if resource_monthly_limit < 1: We can't change the system all at once. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.dues += 0.5;
    Q.workers_rep -= 3;
    Q.unemployed_rep -= 3;
    if (Q.unemployed >= 15) {
        Q.workers_rep -= 10;
        Q.unemployed_rep -= 10;
    }
    if (Q.dues >= 5) {
        Q.workers_rep -= 3 * Q.dues;
        Q.unemployed_rep -= 3 * Q.dues;
    }
    Q.middle_class_dissent += 1;
    Q.resource_monthly_limit -= 1;
!}
go-to: monies_menu

Our members grumble at this, and some of the less committed members leave. But now, we have access to additional resources.

[? if unemployed >= 15 : Because of the presently high unemployment, our members are feeling the extra burden hard. ?]

@increase_patronage
subtitle: [? if patronage < -7: <span style="color: #66BB6A;">**Extremely low**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage = -7 : <span style="color: #66BB6A;">**Extremely low**</span> Patronage -> <span style="color: #81C784;">**low**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage < -3 and patronage > -7: <span style="color: #81C784;">**low**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage = -3 : <span style="color: #81C784;">**low**</span> Patronage -> <span style="color: #FFD54F;">**medium**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage < 2 and patronage > -3: <span style="color: #FFD54F;">**medium**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage = 2 : <span style="color: #FFD54F;">**medium**</span> Patronage -> <span style="color: #FFB74D;">**high**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage < 6 and patronage > 2: <span style="color: #FFD54F;">**medium**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage = 6 : <span style="color: #FFB74D;">**high**</span> Patronage -> <span style="color: #d42f2f;">**Extremely high**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage > 6: <span style="color: #d42f2f;">**Extremely high**</span> Patronage ?]
choose-if: patronage < 10 and resource_monthly_limit >= 1 and civil_service_reform = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if civil_service_reform = 1: We outlawed such forms of fundraising ?][? if patronage >= 10: DUDE! STOP HANDING OUT Jobs ?][? if resource_monthly_limit < 1: We can't change the system all at once. ?]
on-arrival: patronage += 1; corruption += 3; middle_class_dissent += 2; reform_dissent += 3; conservative_dissent += 1; resource_monthly_limit -= 1
go-to: monies_menu

We expand our use of patronage in state and federal government.

@decrease_patronage
subtitle: [? if patronage < -7: <span style="color: #66BB6A;">**Extremely low**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage = -7 : <span style="color: #66BB6A;">**Extremely low**</span> Patronage <- <span style="color: #81C784;">**low**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage < -3 and patronage > -7: <span style="color: #81C784;">**low**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage = -3 : <span style="color: #81C784;">**low**</span> Patronage <- <span style="color: #FFD54F;">**medium**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage < 2 and patronage > -3: <span style="color: #FFD54F;">**medium**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage = 2 : <span style="color: #FFD54F;">**medium**</span> Patronage <- <span style="color: #FFB74D;">**high**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage < 6 and patronage > 2: <span style="color: #FFD54F;">**medium**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage = 6 : <span style="color: #FFB74D;">**high**</span> Patronage <- <span style="color: #d42f2f;">**Extremely high**</span> Patronage ?][? if patronage > 6: <span style="color: #d42f2f;">**Extremely high**</span> Patronage ?]
choose-if: patronage > -10 and resource_monthly_limit >= 1 and civil_service_reform = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if civil_service_reform = 1: We outlawed such forms of fundraising ?][? if patronage <= -10: Our system is a total meritocracy. ?][? if resource_monthly_limit < 1: We can't change the system all at once. ?]
on-arrival: patronage -= 1; corruption -= 2; middle_class_dissent -= 1; reform_dissent -= 2; workers_rep -= 1; resource_monthly_limit -= 1
go-to: monies_menu

We reduce our use of patronage in state and federal government.

@increase_assessments
subtitle: [+ salary_cut_disp + 10 +]%
choose-if: salary_cut < 0.70 and resource_monthly_limit >= 1 and civil_service_reform = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if civil_service_reform = 1: We outlawed such forms of fundraising ?][? if salary_cut >= 0.70: We can't expect to demand more from their salary. ?][? if resource_monthly_limit < 1: We can't change the system all at once. ?]
on-arrival: salary_cut += 0.1; salary_cut_disp += 10; corruption += 2; middle_class_dissent += 1; reform_dissent += 2; resource_monthly_limit -= 1
go-to: monies_menu

We increase the percentage that our government employees have to pay to the party.

@decrease_assessments
subtitle: [+ salary_cut_disp - 10 +]%
choose-if: salary_cut > 0 and resource_monthly_limit >= 1 and civil_service_reform = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if civil_service_reform = 1: We outlawed such forms of fundraising ?][? if salary_cut <= 0: We are currently assessment free. ?][? if resource_monthly_limit < 1: We can't change the system all at once. ?]
on-arrival: salary_cut -= 0.1; salary_cut_disp -= 10; corruption -= 2; reform_dissent -= 1; middle_class_rep += 1; resource_monthly_limit -= 1
go-to: monies_menu

We decrease the percentage that our government employees have to pay to the party.

@business_donations
subtitle: [+ big_monies + 1 : big_monies +] Donations
choose-if: big_monies < 10 and resource_monthly_limit >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if big_monies >= 10: We are already receiving everything they are willing to give. ?][? if resource_monthly_limit < 1: We can't change the system all at once. ?]
on-arrival: big_monies += 1; corruption += 3; middle_class_dem -= 1; reform_dissent += 2; rural_dissent += 1; resource_monthly_limit -= 1
go-to: monies_menu

We encourage wealthy individuals and businesses to donate to our cause.

@business_donations_no
subtitle: [+ big_monies - 1 : big_monies +] Donation
choose-if: big_monies > -10 and resource_monthly_limit >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if big_monies <= -10: Business fundraising in the party is minimal. ?][? if resource_monthly_limit < 1: We can't change the system all at once. ?]
on-arrival: big_monies -= 1; corruption -= 1; reform_dissent -= 1; middle_class_dem += 1; resource_monthly_limit -= 1
go-to: monies_menu

We discourage wealthy individuals and businesses from donating to our cause.

@collect
subtitle: + [+ monies_disp +]
on-arrival: {!

    let monies = Math.min(6, Math.max(0, Math.round(Q.dues * 1.0 + (Math.max(0, Q.patronage) / 10) * 2 + Q.salary_cut * 3 + (Math.max(0, Q.big_monies) / 10) * 3)));
    Q.resources += monies;

!}

We cashed out big time!